# 'unsafe-inline' in style-src is required because:
#   - Astro SSG emits component <style> blocks inline in the HTML.
#
# LIMITATION: 'unsafe-inline' in script-src does NOT block inline
# <script> injection via set:html. It blocks external script loads
# and cross-origin iframes/objects. The hash-based fix (task #329)
# is required to close the inline XSS vector fully.
